 ## ================= list vs set =====================

         list                     |       set

- stores multiple data types      | - stores multiple data types but unique values
- it is orderes(sequence)         | - unordered (no sequence)
- allow duplicates                | - only allow unique values (can't allow duplicates )
- here indexing is there          | - there is no index because it is unordered
- it is represent as []           | - it is represent as {}




